|errata_history=The Holotable repository first records this image on 2019-01-25. The E image is turned through 180 degrees, placing the Dark Side text below the artwork. The game text is unchanged across these three images. <!-- pce-dark-comparison-2 --> '''Before and after the published image change:''' '''Before (2018-07-08)''' [[File:PC-1-282-image-1-visible-detail.png|frameless|300px]] '''After (2019-01-25)''' [[File:PC-1-282-image-2-visible-detail.png|frameless|300px]]. '''Full source face before:''' [[File:Premiere-D-Dantooine-PC-E1-2018-07-08.gif|frameless|300px]] '''Full source face after:''' [[File:Premiere-D-Dantooine-PC-E2-2019-01-25.gif|frameless|300px]]. '''Game text before:''' [[File:Dantooine-Dark-PC-E1-top-text.png|frameless|300px]] [[File:Dantooine-Dark-PC-E1-bottom-text.png|frameless|300px]] '''Game text after:''' [[File:Dantooine-Dark-PC-E2-top-text.png|frameless|300px]] [[File:Dantooine-Dark-PC-E2-bottom-text.png|frameless|300px]]. <!-- pce-dark-mark-2 --> '''PC transcription error — printed errata mark:''' This is image 3 in the published PC chronology; the face prints the unnumbered mark <code>E</code>. The article number follows image order, and the printed mark is preserved. Source dates are first located records, not proven first publication days.
